The [[Online (open beta)|online beta]] received a patch on December 8th, 2023, announced on [https://twitter.com/tyronerodriguez/status/1733302031669203074 Twitter].

== Documented Changes ==
* Fixed unrecognized controller softlock
* Fixed false report mods as being active
* Create new match if all run results in-progress
* Small delay to active item after boss intro
* Caps lock works in text chat
* Profanity filter tweaked

